{"id":"657785","name":"紫菜虾仁炒饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/657785/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾仁","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉饼","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"紫菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虾剥去壳去虾线后洗净切小丁。","img":"images/657785/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉饼改刀切小丁。","img":"images/657785/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋打入碗中搅拌均匀。","img":"images/657785/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅加热后放入紫菜，将两面烘至军绿色，取出放入保鲜袋捏碎。","img":"images/657785/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入虾仁炒至变色。","img":"images/657785/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油倒入鸡蛋炒散后盛出。","img":"images/657785/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"热油放入肉饼炒至金黄。","img":"images/657785/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入煲好的米饭。","img":"images/657785/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入炒过的鸡蛋和虾仁。","img":"images/657785/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量盐，将米饭和配料炒匀。","img":"images/657785/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"最后放入紫菜翻炒均匀即可。","img":"images/657785/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657785/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657785/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657785/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657785/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}